# Golden evidence tiering: Git keeps reproducible fixtures, JSON evidence,
# final outputs, and signoff records; bulky intermediate bitmaps, repair
# attempt archives, and source boards stay local or ship as release assets.
release-evidence/golden-samples/_sources/
release-evidence/golden-samples/*/attempts/
release-evidence/golden-samples/*/evidence/workspace/**/*.png
release-evidence/golden-samples/*/evidence/workspace/style/fonts/
release-evidence/golden-samples/*/evidence/workspace/workflow/history/
